libformfactor
------------------------------------------
C++ library for the efficient computation of scattering form factors (Fourier
shape transforms) of arbitrary polyhedra

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libformfactor-devel-0.5.1-1bl1
  libformfactor0-0.5.1-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libheinz-4.1.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://jugit.fz-juelich.de/mlz/lib/formfactor

Canonical download:
  https://jugit.fz-juelich.de/mlz/lib/formfactor/-/archive/v0.5.1/formfactor-v0.5.1.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libformfactor-0.5.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libformfactor-0.5.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libformfactor-0.5.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libformfactor-0.5.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libformfactor0-0.5.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libformfactor-devel-0.5.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libformfactor)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libformfactor.README
  /usr/share/doc/libformfactor/CHANGELOG
  /usr/share/doc/libformfactor/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libformfactor/README.md

(libformfactor0)
  /usr/bin/cygformfactor-0.dll

(libformfactor-devel)
  /usr/include/ff/Box.h
  /usr/include/ff/Face.h
  /usr/include/ff/IBody.h
  /usr/include/ff/Make.h
  /usr/include/ff/Polyhedron.h
  /usr/include/ff/Prism.h
  /usr/include/ff/Topology.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/formfactor/formfactorConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/formfactor/formfactorConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/formfactor/formfactorTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/formfactor/formfactorTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libformfactor.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libformfactor.pc

